  "html": "<p>Linux 没有 Windows 那样的盘符概念，整套系统从唯一的根目录 <code>/</code> 向下展开，绝大多数管理任务都能通过高频命令组合管道与重定向完成。这份速查把日常使用最频繁的目录路径、文件操作、文本检索、网络与系统监控、压缩归档以及用户权限命令集中整理，方便随时检索核对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目录结构与路径规则\">目录结构与路径规则</h2>\n<p><strong>Linux 只有唯一的顶级目录 <code>/</code>，路径层级全部用 <code>/</code> 分隔；以 <code>/</code> 开头的是绝对路径，其余都是以当前工作目录为起点的相对路径。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/remote-assets/c6eba162bc8c7992455ac2f9a9163ddc7ccc7121.png\" alt=\"Linux 根目录与常见系统子目录树结构\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>例如 <code>/home/app/a.txt</code> 表示根目录 <code>/</code> 下 <code>home</code> 目录中的 <code>app/a.txt</code>。每个登录用户都有专属的 <code>HOME</code> 目录：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>普通用户默认位于 <code>/home/用户名</code>；</li>\n<li><code>root</code> 管理员默认位于 <code>/root</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>特殊路径符号与相对/绝对路径速查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/</code> 开头</td>\n<td>绝对路径，从根目录起算</td>\n<td><code>/etc/profile</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 <code>/</code> 开头</td>\n<td>相对路径，从当前目录起算</td>\n<td><code>test/a.txt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.</code></td>\n<td>当前目录</td>\n<td><code>./run.sh</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>..</code></td>\n<td>上级目录</td>\n<td><code>../..</code> 表示上两级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~</code></td>\n<td>当前用户的 <code>HOME</code> 目录</td>\n<td><code>cd ~</code> 切回主目录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"目录浏览文件增删与内容查看\">目录浏览、文件增删与内容查看</h2>\n<p><strong>在 Linux 中以 <code>.</code> 开头的文件或目录默认隐藏，必须配合 <code>ls -a</code> 才能看到；<code>rm -rf</code> 尤其是切到 <code>root</code> 后执行不会弹窗确认，下手前务必核对路径。</strong></p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看目录与路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -lah</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [目标目录]       </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># -l 列表、-a 含隐藏文件、-h 人类可读大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 打印当前工作目录绝对路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [目标目录]            </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不带参数时默认切回当前用户 HOME 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建目录与空文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a/b/c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # -p 自动创建不存在的父级目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">touch</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 创建空文件或更新时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复制、移动/重命名与删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src_dir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dst_dir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # -r 递归复制目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mv</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> old.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 目标不存在时相当于重命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # -r 递归删目录，-f 强制不提示（慎用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看文件与命令位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.conf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 一次性输出全文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">more</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 分页查看：空格翻页，q 退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">head</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 查看前 20 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tail</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # -n 指定行数，-f 持续跟踪追加日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">which</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 查询命令可执行文件的绝对路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>需要查清命令的全部参数时，直接看内建帮助或系统手册比记零散选项更可靠：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --help</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 查看简要参数说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">man</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 打开完整联机手册（按 q 退出）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"检索统计管道与重定向\">检索、统计、管道与重定向</h2>\n<p><strong>管道符 <code>|</code> 把左侧命令的标准输出接给右侧命令的标准输入，而 <code>&gt;</code>（覆盖）和 <code>&gt;&gt;</code>（追加）把标准输出写入文件；反引号 <code>`cmd`</code> 或 <code>$(cmd)</code> 会先执行内部命令并把输出替换到当前命令行。</strong></p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按文件名搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.log\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤匹配关键字并显示行号（含空格的关键字用双引号包裹）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ERROR\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/app.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计字节数、字符数、行数、单词数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 管道嵌套组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"502\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"/api\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出文本、命令替换与重定向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"current dir: $(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &gt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 覆盖写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"appended at $(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &gt;&gt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 追加写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"vi--vim-编辑器高频快捷键\">vi / vim 编辑器高频快捷键</h2>\n<p><strong><code>vi</code> 的核心是分清命令模式、输入模式与底线命令模式：在任何输入状态下按 <code>Esc</code> 退回命令模式，再决定移动、删改还是 <code>:wq</code> 保存退出。</strong></p>\n<p>命令模式进入输入模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>按键</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i</code> / <code>a</code></td>\n<td>在当前光标前 / 后进入输入模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>I</code> / <code>A</code></td>\n<td>跳到当前行首 / 行尾进入输入模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>o</code> / <code>O</code></td>\n<td>在当前行下方 / 上方新开一行进入输入模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Esc</code></td>\n<td>退出输入模式回到命令模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>命令模式光标移动、搜索与编辑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>按键</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>h</code> / <code>j</code> / <code>k</code> / <code>l</code></td>\n<td>左 / 下 / 上 / 右移动光标（等价方向键）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0</code> / <code>$</code></td>\n<td>跳到当前行首 / 行尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gg</code> / <code>G</code></td>\n<td>跳到文件首行 / 末行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/关键字</code></td>\n<td>向下搜索，<code>n</code> 下一个匹配、<code>N</code> 上一个匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dd</code> / <code>ndd</code></td>\n<td>删除当前行 / 向下 <code>n</code> 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dG</code> / <code>dgg</code> / <code>d$</code> / <code>d0</code></td>\n<td>删到文件尾 / 文件头 / 行尾 / 行首</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yy</code> / <code>nyy</code> / <code>p</code></td>\n<td>复制当前行 / <code>n</code> 行，并粘贴到光标下方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u</code> / <code>Ctrl + r</code></td>\n<td>撤销 / 反向撤销（重做）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>底线命令模式（命令模式下按 <code>:</code> 输入）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:w</code> / <code>:q</code> / <code>:wq</code></td>\n<td>仅保存 / 仅退出 / 保存并退出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:q!</code></td>\n<td>不保存强制退出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:set nu</code> / <code>:set paste</code></td>\n<td>显示行号 / 开启粘贴模式（防自动缩进错乱）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"软件安装服务软链接与时间同步\">软件安装、服务、软链接与时间同步</h2>\n<p><strong>包管理器 <code>yum</code>（CentOS/RHEL）与 <code>apt</code>（Ubuntu/Debian）及 <code>systemctl</code> 均涉及系统级变更，通常需要 <code>root</code> 或 <code>sudo</code> 权限；系统服务与软链接路径建议始终写绝对路径，避免工作目录切换后失效。</strong></p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CentOS / Ubuntu 软件包管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yum</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yum</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yum</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> search</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># systemd 服务控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stop</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">status</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enable</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">disable</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建软链接（快捷方式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ln</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/local/app/bin/app</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/bin/app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 日期格式化与时间偏移计算（支持 year/month/day/hour/minute/second）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"+1 day\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"+%Y-%m-%d\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"-2 hour\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改系统时区为上海并同步时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/localtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ln</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/share/zoneinfo/Asia/Shanghai</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/localtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yum</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ntp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ntpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ntpdate</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ntp.aliyun.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>date</code> 常用格式符：<code>%Y</code> 四位年份、<code>%y</code> 两位年份、<code>%m</code> 月（<code>01..12</code>）、<code>%d</code> 日（<code>01..31</code>）、<code>%H</code> 时（<code>00..23</code>）、<code>%M</code> 分（<code>00..59</code>）、<code>%S</code> 秒（<code>00..60</code>）、<code>%s</code> Unix 秒级时间戳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络排查进程管理与系统监控\">网络排查、进程管理与系统监控</h2>\n<p><strong>排查服务连不通或机器卡顿时，通常按“主机名与 IP → 端口占用（<code>netstat</code> / <code>nmap</code>）→ 进程（<code>ps</code> / <code>top</code>）→ 磁盘与网络 I/O（<code>df</code> / <code>iostat</code> / <code>sar</code>）”顺序逐层缩窄范围。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"ip主机名与静态网卡配置\">IP、主机名与静态网卡配置</h3>\n<p><code>127.0.0.1</code> 指代本机回环地址；<code>0.0.0.0</code> 在路由表里常代表任意地址，在服务监听配置中表示绑定本机全部网卡地址。</p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ifconfig</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 查看网卡与 IP 地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hostname</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 查看当前主机名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hostnamectl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-hostname</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-01</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 设置主机名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>CentOS 7 静态 IP 网卡配置示例（<code>/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-ens33</code>）：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"ini\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-ini\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TYPE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ethernet\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PROXY_METHOD</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BROWSER_ONLY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOTPROTO</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"static\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFROUTE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV4_FAILURE_FATAL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV6INIT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV6_AUTOCONF</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV6_DEFROUTE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV6_FAILURE_FATAL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPV6_ADDR_GEN_MODE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stable-privacy\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NAME</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ens33\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UUID</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1b0011cb-0d2e-4eaa-8a11-af7d50ebc876\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEVICE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ens33\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ONBOOT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IPADDR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"192.168.88.131\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NETMASK</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"255.255.255.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GATEWAY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"192.168.88.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DNS1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"192.168.88.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"连通性测试端口与文件下载\">连通性测试、端口与文件下载</h3>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 连通性测试（不加 -c 会持续发送 ICMP 请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ping</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> baidu.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描端口占用与查看本机监听端口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nmap</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 127.0.0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">netstat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -anp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 非交互式下载与 HTTP 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://example.com/archive.tar.gz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # -b 后台下载，日志写入 wget-log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tail</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wget-log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                             # 监控后台下载进度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cip.cc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                  # 查询出口公网 IP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://example.com/archive.tar.gz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # -O 按原文件名保存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>注意：<code>wget</code> 无论最终是否下载成功都会在当前目录创建目标文件，中断后记得手动清理残缺文件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进程与资源监控ps--kill--top--df--iostat--sar\">进程与资源监控（<code>ps</code> / <code>kill</code> / <code>top</code> / <code>df</code> / <code>iostat</code> / <code>sar</code>）</h3>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ps</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -ef</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tail</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 查看匹配进程与 PID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 46712</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 发送终止信号请求进程退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -9</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2339</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # -9 强制杀死无响应进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">df</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 查看各挂载点磁盘空间占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iostat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 每 2 秒刷新一次扩展磁盘 I/O 指标，共 5 次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DEV</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 每 3 秒统计一次网卡收发包与吞吐，共 2 次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>iostat -x</code> 与 <code>sar -n DEV</code> 核心指标速查：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>iostat -x</code>：<code>tps</code> 每秒 I/O 请求数、<code>rKB/s</code> 与 <code>wKB/s</code> 读写吞吐、<code>await</code> 单次 I/O 平均等待时间（ms）、<code>%util</code> 磁盘繁忙度。</li>\n<li><code>sar -n DEV</code>：<code>rxpck/s</code> / <code>txpck/s</code> 每秒收发包数、<code>rxKB/s</code> / <code>txKB/s</code> 每秒收发 KB 数、<code>rxmcst/s</code> 每秒多播包数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>top</code> 命令常用参数与交互快捷键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令行选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>交互按键</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-p PID</code></td>\n<td>只监控指定进程</td>\n<td><code>h</code></td>\n<td>显示帮助界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-d 秒</code></td>\n<td>设置刷新间隔（默认 5s）</td>\n<td><code>P</code> / <code>M</code> / <code>T</code></td>\n<td>按 CPU / 常驻内存 RES / 累计时间排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-c</code></td>\n<td>显示完整启动命令</td>\n<td><code>c</code> / <code>i</code></td>\n<td>切换完整命令显示 / 隐藏空闲与僵尸进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-n 次数</code></td>\n<td>刷新指定次数后退出</td>\n<td><code>t</code> / <code>m</code> / <code>l</code></td>\n<td>切换 CPU / 内存 / 负载摘要显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-b</code></td>\n<td>批处理模式，配合 <code>-n</code> 重定向输出</td>\n<td><code>E</code> / <code>e</code></td>\n<td>切换顶部摘要与进程列表的内存单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-u 用户</code></td>\n<td>只显示特定用户进程</td>\n<td><code>f</code></td>\n<td>自定义展示字段列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"环境变量与压缩归档\">环境变量与压缩归档</h2>\n<p><strong><code>PATH</code> 决定了 Shell 去哪些目录找可执行命令；<code>export</code> 只在当前会话生效，永久配置必须写入用户 <code>~/.bashrc</code> 或全局 <code>/etc/profile</code>。</strong></p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 环境变量读取与拼接（变量名相邻字符时用 ${} 隔离边界）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PATH</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PATH</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:/opt/bin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> APP_ENV</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># tar.gz 打包与解压</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -zcvf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backup.tar.gz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.conf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -zxvf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backup.tar.gz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/restore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># zip 打包（含目录必须加 -r）与解压</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundle.zip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dir1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dir2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unzip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundle.zip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /home/app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"用户用户组与文件权限\">用户、用户组与文件权限</h2>\n<p><strong>文件权限由属主（u）、属组（g）和其他用户（o）三组 <code>rwx</code> 位构成，八进制数字是 <code>r=4</code>、<code>w=2</code>、<code>x=1</code> 的按位相加；普通用户临时提权优先配置 <code>visudo</code> 走 <code>sudo</code>，不要直接长期挂 <code>root</code> 操作。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/remote-assets/2bbcf34a5e4757c0ed7306d062c46f98068323a2.png\" alt=\"Linux 文件权限数字与 rwx 位对应关系\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 切换用户（带 - 会重新加载目标用户的环境变量）与 sudo 提权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">su</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>通过 <code>visudo</code> 为指定用户授权免密 <code>sudo</code>：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>app ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre>\n<p>权限、属主修改与用户/组管理命令：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改权限与属主/属组（-R 递归应用到目录下全部内容）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 755</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> root</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hello.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 仅改属主</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :appgroup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hello.txt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 仅改属组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app:appgroup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/app</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 同时修改属主和属组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户组与用户管理（需 root 权限）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupadd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupdel</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useradd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /home/alice</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 不加 -g 会新建同名组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">userdel</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # -r 连同 HOME 目录一并删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                              # 查看用户 UID 与所属组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">usermod</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -aG</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 将用户追加到附加组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询系统全部用户组与用户清单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getent</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getent</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> passwd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n",
